<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-subpage-hero">
    <p class="gg-eyebrow">About Goal Grower</p>
    <h1>Built by three college students trying to make goals feel less lonely.</h1>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is a student-built app for habits, big goals, shared gardens,
      and visual progress.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-about-story">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h2>We are building the kind of app we wanted to use.</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
      Goal Grower started as a simple idea: what if goals felt less like a
      checklist and more like something alive? Instead of only tracking whether
      you did something, the app turns your effort into a garden that grows over
      time.
    </p>

    <p>
      It is being built by three college students learning how to turn an idea
      into a real product, test it with users, improve the design, and grow a
      small business around it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-team">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">The team</p>
      <h2>Three people. One small garden.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-team-grid">
      <div class="gg-team-card">
        <div class="gg-team-photo"></div>
        <span>Founder / Developer</span>
        <h3>Student Builder</h3>
        <p>Works on the app, website, product direction, and the Goal Grower experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-team-card">
        <div class="gg-team-photo"></div>
        <span>Design / Testing</span>
        <h3>Student Teammate</h3>
        <p>Helps with app feedback, design decisions, testing, and user experience.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-team-card">
        <div class="gg-team-photo"></div>
        <span>Marketing / Support</span>
        <h3>Student Teammate</h3>
        <p>Helps with store ideas, feedback, outreach, and keeping the project moving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-values">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">What we care about</p>
      <h2>Simple values for a better goal app.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-loop-grid">
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>01</span><h3>Return</h3><p>Missing a day should not make someone quit.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>02</span><h3>Visibility</h3><p>Progress should be something people can actually see.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>03</span><h3>Gentleness</h3><p>Motivation does not have to feel loud or stressful.</p></div>
      <div class="gg-loop-card"><span>04</span><h3>Together</h3><p>Shared gardens make growth feel less isolated.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Help us improve</p>
      <h2>Have feedback for the app?</h2>
      <p>We want honest feedback from real people before launch.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Send feedback</a>
  </section>
</main>

